Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why did humankind even bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You rack everything you've ever made, and start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:47.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like there'll be any different after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:55.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I supposed we're not good at facing our memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:58.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'd rather kill the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:03.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Find something worthwile among the rubble and build the future with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:06.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,And that's the reason why you hide Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:09.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,To kill the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:15.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were trying to rid ourselves of a more immediate problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't mean the stigma?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:22.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you're the one who brought that on yourself in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:25.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:31.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess you really do have a short memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:34.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:38.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, it is my choice to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tseng! Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:57.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:01.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:04.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not a pretty sight, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:07.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Just get the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reno, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:29.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Senpai, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:37.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:43.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elena!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:47.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:56.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tsengsan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:11.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are going to give her back eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Lifestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:48.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what we call the river of life that circles our planet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:53.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,giving life to the world and everything in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:57.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Shinra Electric Power Company discovered a way
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:01.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,to use the Lifestream as an energy source.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:08.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because of Shinra's energy, we were able to live very comfortable lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:13.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,But wasn't that because we were taking away from the planet's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:16.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,A lot of people thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:24.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shinra used their power to try and stop anybody who got in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:31.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shinra had a special group of warriors called SOLDIER.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,And all the SOLDIERs had Jenova cells put inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:37.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jenova was a calamity that fell from the sky a long, long time ago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:41.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,and tried to destroy the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:46.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyway, there was one SOLDIER named Sephiroth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,who was better than the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:53.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,But when he found out about the terrible experiments that made him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,he began to hate Shinra.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:06:03.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then, over time, he began to hate everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:09.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shinra and the people against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:11.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sephiroth, who hated the planet so much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:15.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,he wanted to make it go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:18.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the people who tried to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,There were a lot of battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:27.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,For every battle, there was more sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:33.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone I love went back to the Lifestream too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:37.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then, it came.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:39.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,The chosen day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:45.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the end, the planet itself had to make the battles stop for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:50.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,The planet used the Lifestream as a weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:53.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,and when it burst out of the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:59.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,all the fighting, all the greed and sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:02.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,everything was washed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:10.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Sadness was the price to see it end. "
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:13.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been two years since they told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:02.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move it, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:12.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sis, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:13.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,But it looks like the planet is a lot angrier than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,They call it geostigma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:56.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, Marlene? How does it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:05.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please. Please don't take Denzel away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:14.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,"The commission report release this morning has reveal"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:17.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,"That lifestream concentration at the atmosphere"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:20.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Has been drop to a mere hundred of a levels 2 years ago. "
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:26.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,"However, the concentration remains toxic"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Around the Shinra Company main building as well as the company's mako reactors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:29.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,"He's not here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:31.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,"To prevent the onset of Geostigma"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:35.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,"The commission does advice that you stay away from these facilities"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:37.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,"And the surrounding areas. "
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:42.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Next up. Should Shinra be held financial responsible for the crisis? "
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:47.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:05.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Strife Delivery Service. You name it, we ship
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:09.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,May I ask who's calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:40.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a call from Reno. He's in Healin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:42.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Says he's got work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, how have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:46.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have no more messages
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.13,0:12:01.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kadaj? Is that where Big Brother lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:03.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:06.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think he'll be happy to see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:08.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not a chance. Don't cry, Yazoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,But Mother's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:15.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't cry, Loz.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:07.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:14.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,We know you hid her, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:26.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're leading me on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I think you do have Mother there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,No need to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put the president on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're starting to bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:04.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:09.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me, Barret!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:15.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did it! A new oil field! OILFIELD!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:16.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,A huge one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:18.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we're sticking to plan, so soon I'll be able to come visit Marlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:20.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell her for me! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:27.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reno called again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:31.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,He says to hurry, but he sounded kind of strange
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:34.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.61,0:16:04.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Rude, looking sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:27.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just as expected from an exSOLDIER.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You haven't rusted a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:50.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Rufus? You've got no luck either
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,The day of the explosion What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:59.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I managed to get out Who were the guys that attacked me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:01.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,before it colla I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:08.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not interest I acknowledge that Shinra
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:11.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,owes the planet a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:14.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,It goes without saying that my company and I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:18.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,are the ones who put the world in the sorry state it's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:21.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,So we feel we have a responsibility to set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm still out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've already taken the first step
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:29.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,by conducting an investigation in Sephiroth's wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:32.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been 2 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:34.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,now that that the world is on the speed again,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:37.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,what's the threat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:44.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that one's easy, Geostigma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:49.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we have to think Sephiroth is the one responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,The people blame Mako energy, Mako reactors,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:59.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,even the Lifestream for causing the stigma
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:02.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,However, isn't it wrong to put a blame on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:04.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Lifestream existed as long as the Planet and. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:09.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,. . . even Mako evergy has been part of our life for 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,And yet there's no mention about stigma in recorded history.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:21.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what happen during our time to change all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:23.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can only think of one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:26.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sephiroth's awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:27.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sephiroth is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:29.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course, but what about his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:34.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if somehow he dissolve into the Lifestream coursing with the Planet undiffuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:37.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if somehow he dissolve into the Lifestream coursing with the Planet undiffuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:42.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, it's merely my speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:45.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, there are possibilities right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:49.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we can't cure the stigma until we know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:55.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,So we took the first step, and went to look for traces of Sephiroth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:19:00.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you by any chance, still remember where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,At the Northern Cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think we found?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:10.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,We didn't find anything. You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:15.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,However, not all went as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:19.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were interrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:32.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tsengsan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:36.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kadaj's gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:39.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kadaj?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:44.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really, what could they be thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:46.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,What does that have to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:48.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are going to give her back eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:53.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your ties with Sephiroth run as deep as our too Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:59.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if Kadaj goal is to prepare for an imminent occasion
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:03.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should be prepared for the upcoming threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prepare?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:07.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sephiroth
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:10.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:11.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you done talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:13.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get things clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:19.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,In order to battle with Kadaj, we need someone with your expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:21.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:24.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,SOLDIER member, Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:27.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Former.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this stuff about 'Mother'?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.81,0:20:40.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beats me. Didn't Kadaj mention anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.75,0:20:44.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you hiding something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:49.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never keep a secret, especially from a comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:53.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you wanted to learn more about the stigma?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:57.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Obviously for the sake of those orphan you live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:03.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see the smile of the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:10.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,All we want in the end is to rebuild our world, Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:20.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I Come on, Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Together, we can rebuild Shinra!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:29.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reno! Reno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:54.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does Cloud live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:57.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:06.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:29.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just like Denzel. Is Cloud sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:32.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he just say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:35.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did he leave because he's sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.59,0:22:38.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,He wants to fight alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.34,0:22:40.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fight? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:45.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:47.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tifa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:51.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go back, Marlene?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.41,0:22:55.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! I wanna see Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:07.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice to see him, huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:10.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, what should we do when he gets here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:12.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll all go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.76,0:23:16.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Before that, we'll lecture him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.57,0:23:18.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:23.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to find Tseng and Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:28.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,The other employees give you any leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.55,0:23:30.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.52,0:23:39.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who have thought, Shinra's employee return to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.85,0:23:44.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now that's dedicate. I'm telling you this going to be a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.81,0:23:48.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, those who alive have a lot to atone for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.25,0:23:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been 2 years already, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.16,0:23:58.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems a lot longer than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.38,0:24:01.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a nightmare huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.77,0:24:04.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,The world was almost done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we're a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.41,0:24:13.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seriously though, how we're supposed to atone for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.85,0:24:18.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Too bad the directors not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:20.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Elena too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.36,0:24:26.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope they're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.37,0:24:28.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.15,0:24:32.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tseng is just like the President. They always escape from the death god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:34.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:36.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:47.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.09,0:25:00.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Church?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.30,0:25:05.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, I know that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.27,0:25:08.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.50,0:26:40.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your call to Sector 7 cannot be reached at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.69,0:26:45.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your call to Sector 7 cannot be reached at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:50.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your call to Sector 7 cannot be reached at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.84,0:26:56.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your call to Sector 7 cannot be reached at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.31,0:27:01.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your call to Sector 7 cannot be reached at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.16,0:27:39.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, you rarely call back aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.56,0:27:41.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.34,0:27:45.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.36,0:27:48.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,No it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.54,0:27:52.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's this? Isn't this Cloud's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.61,0:27:54.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.57,0:27:56.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:28:03.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Please, I don't know what to do, I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.31,0:28:08.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.24,0:28:19.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happen? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.39,0:28:22.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud! Cloud! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.07,0:28:31.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:38.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.96,0:29:23.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hate liars.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.29,0:29:27.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I apologize. This time you'll get the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.78,0:29:31.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,The object you seek fell from the helicopter while we were running from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.63,0:29:34.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a ridiculous story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.18,0:29:36.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:39.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.93,0:29:43.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then swear on these.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.42,0:29:54.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this? We need Mother's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.88,0:29:59.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Reunion is coming and we need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:00.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reunion?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.37,0:30:04.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,My brothers and sisters who share Mother's cells will all assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.94,0:30:07.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,And together, we'll take revenge on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.07,0:30:11.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've already sent out the invitations, but you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.18,0:30:15.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone's gone and hidden the guest of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.08,0:30:17.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Invitations?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:22.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,The stigma. But you know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.06,0:30:27.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother's memetic legacy lives on in the Lifestream and makes it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.29,0:30:34.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,She does so much for us, and we don't even know where to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.33,0:30:41.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,But what can we do, we're just remnants of Mother's legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:47.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Until we find Mother and receive her cells, we can't be whole again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.08,0:30:51.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Geostigma and a legacy aren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.22,0:30:54.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not for a true Reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.42,0:30:55.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.76,0:31:02.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, surely you've noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:40.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.78,0:31:45.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,The stigma!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.57,0:31:52.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't you people just stay indoors?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.18,0:32:08.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.01,0:32:41.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I said I'd live out both our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.99,0:32:45.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.45,0:32:48.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna be in SOLDIER? Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.86,0:32:50.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, how're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.53,0:32:53.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna do once we get to Midgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.12,0:32:56.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.36,0:33:06.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Old man, stop somewhere behind a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.83,0:33:08.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, wee getting off!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.07,0:33:14.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,My dreams and pride
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.08,0:33:18.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can have them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.20,0:33:20.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.75,0:33:24.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,the proof that I existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.79,0:33:31.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,On that day, I swore I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.61,0:33:34.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, I
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.98,0:33:44.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you're sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.90,0:33:49.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why tremble with anger that's not even there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.41,0:33:54.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know why, Cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.10,0:33:58.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,All you are, is an empty puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.19,0:34:27.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:32.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess that's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.73,0:34:36.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.61,0:34:45.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,It stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.98,0:34:51.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Mother? There's no one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.65,0:34:55.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine. Play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.17,0:35:10.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,This'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.05,0:36:28.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tifa!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.81,0:36:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.58,0:37:02.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.92,0:37:06.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it. I'll bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.82,0:37:13.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Time to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.72,0:38:13.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.92,0:38:14.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.18,0:38:35.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,About earlier, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:39.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.26,0:38:48.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,My brother
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.95,0:38:53.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.98,0:38:56.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.43,0:39:00.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got the stigma too?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.55,0:39:03.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, they're gonna fix us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.27,0:39:57.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tifa?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.91,0:40:01.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tifa!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.22,0:40:09.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're late
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.48,0:40:11.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.32,0:40:15.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,He didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.79,0:40:18.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marlene? !
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.84,0:40:27.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.07,0:41:40.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're pretty heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.81,0:41:44.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were living with some kids, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.55,0:41:46.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,They ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.49,0:41:52.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.29,0:41:56.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.20,0:42:09.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a real handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.94,0:42:24.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tifa said to take you home, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.27,0:42:28.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.76,0:43:05.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are these people that's going to fix us?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.19,0:43:10.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.12,0:43:17.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.35,0:43:38.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,So Big Brother was hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.13,0:43:43.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the power of the Lifestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.36,0:43:51.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,This materia will give us renewed power.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.93,0:43:57.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, those were a gift from Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.52,0:43:59.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yea, it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.40,0:44:02.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then, Brother is hiding Mother too?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.35,0:44:06.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. It's that President guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.27,0:44:10.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keeping things hidden is something Shinra's people are very good at
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.04,0:44:16.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then we have to look everywhere that have to do with Shinra.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.54,0:44:20.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pretty soon, we'll have plenty of helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.31,0:44:23.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.72,0:44:27.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,But first.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.13,0:44:30.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to have a talk with Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.35,0:44:34.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,He likes to pretend as if he's not a part of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.38,0:44:38.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,He makes me sad, really sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.56,0:44:47.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.56,0:45:10.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reno and Rude are looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.80,0:45:19.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have geostigma, don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.84,0:45:24.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,So it's okay to just give up and die. Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.14,0:45:30.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,It knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.55,0:45:33.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.82,0:45:36.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not stopping Denzel from fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.15,0:45:39.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't run. Let's fight it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.59,0:45:42.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can help each other, I know we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.93,0:45:48.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or do we have to be a real family for that to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.10,0:45:50.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.27,0:45:54.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,am not fit to help anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.60,0:45:59.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not my family, not my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.31,0:46:00.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.75,0:46:05.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dillydally, shillyshally
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.59,0:46:13.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dillydally, shillyshally
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.56,0:46:16.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think she wants you to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.73,0:46:18.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.59,0:46:20.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.16,0:46:23.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Saw them being taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.00,0:46:27.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are they? The Forgotten City.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.30,0:46:29.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Their base.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.09,0:46:47.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've received a special power from Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.12,0:46:50.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,The power to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.33,0:46:53.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,against a planet that torments its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.83,0:47:00.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,She gave this power to all her children.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.67,0:47:02.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.21,0:47:06.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and I are brethren.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.51,0:47:09.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brothers and sisters chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.41,0:47:13.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,when we inherited Mother's memetic legacy through the Lifestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.08,0:47:17.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.85,0:47:21.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,the planet doesn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.76,0:47:25.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's trying to hold us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.03,0:47:31.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why it's been racking our bodies with pain, filling our hearts with doubt!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.87,0:47:35.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will heal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.61,0:47:39.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then we will go to Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.61,0:47:44.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,We will join as a family and strike back at the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.82,0:47:51.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.67,0:48:39.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Denzel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.47,0:48:44.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Denzel!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.69,0:48:58.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.28,0:49:01.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,All my new siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.54,0:49:08.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,They will keep me company until I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.27,0:49:49.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.27,0:49:54.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even though you're about to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.54,0:49:57.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.21,0:50:00.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna ask something!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.58,0:50:03.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why exactly did you come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.75,0:50:09.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I want to be forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.55,0:50:13.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I want to be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.86,0:50:16.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.38,0:51:07.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.12,0:51:09.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here for the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.32,0:51:12.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,See this man? He's our big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.12,0:51:14.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.06,0:51:18.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.63,0:51:21.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.03,0:51:26.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.94,0:53:48.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I really can't save anyone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.64,0:53:52.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vincent. What do you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.58,0:53:56.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I come here often.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.92,0:54:01.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've seen what Kadaj's group is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.16,0:54:04.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,The stigma.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.23,0:54:07.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Inside our bodies, we all have a current like the Lifestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.10,0:54:10.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,When alien matter infests the body, this current is what fights it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.83,0:54:16.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a flow through the body like the Lifestream
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.24,0:54:20.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,It fights against the invasion of harmful substances.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.44,0:54:24.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Harmful substances
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.01,0:54:28.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Sephiroth gene. Jenova's memetic legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.38,0:54:30.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call it what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.79,0:54:34.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're wellinformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.86,0:54:36.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tseng and Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.96,0:54:39.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,They were brought here halfdead.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.39,0:54:42.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,They must have been brutally tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.06,0:54:46.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did what I could to save them
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.10,0:54:49.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,but it was ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.57,0:54:51.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tortured?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.51,0:54:53.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,They had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.21,0:54:55.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,They got their hands on Jenova's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.18,0:54:59.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then the "Mother"Kadaj is looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.25,0:55:03.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heaven's dark harbinger. The calamity, Jenova.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.15,0:55:07.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,If they wanted to, they could make another Sephiroth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.86,0:55:10.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kadaj
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.03,0:55:12.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.69,0:55:15.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.87,0:55:27.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.08,0:55:30.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud! Denzel and Tifa!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.78,0:55:31.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tifa is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.11,0:55:34.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.29,0:55:40.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.29,0:55:44.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.39,0:55:49.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vincent, will you take Marlene back to the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.96,0:55:52.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get some answers from Shinra.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.27,0:55:54.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know I can't. But
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.74,0:55:56.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.40,0:55:59.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why won't you listen to what we're trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.08,0:56:06.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marlene, please give me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.55,0:56:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a battle to be fought
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.05,0:56:11.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,but it's not as simple as just fighting it. You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.79,0:56:13.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.65,0:56:16.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, is this really about the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.83,0:56:19.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.06,0:56:21.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Forgotten City.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.93,0:56:24.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ajit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.90,0:56:29.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.91,0:56:38.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to talk to Rufus. Stop running!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.65,0:56:40.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.01,0:56:43.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even if you find the kids, you might not be able to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.72,0:56:46.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe something will happen that can never unhappen.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.35,0:56:47.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,That scares you, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.91,0:56:50.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you need to think about now. Take it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.62,0:56:53.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think you've got it hard? Tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.36,0:56:55.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sharing your life with other people is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.03,0:56:57.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you don't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.73,0:57:01.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You might not answer the phone, but you won't throw it away either.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.07,0:57:07.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just go to Ajit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.22,0:57:19.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to lose out to our memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.59,0:57:29.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.30,0:57:32.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really, you're always drifting
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.10,0:57:36.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, why can't you forgive yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.51,0:57:42.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are sins ever forgiven?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.14,0:57:44.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've never tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.95,0:57:46.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tried it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.01,0:57:48.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tried it
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.22,0:57:54.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marlene, let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.26,0:58:00.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.20,0:58:03.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.68,0:58:25.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's me, Reeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.29,0:58:27.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's work going?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.72,0:58:31.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I saw your flyer. How the hell do you stay in business?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.29,0:58:33.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never change, Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.76,0:58:35.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about helping you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.76,0:58:37.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I guess I'll call back another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.46,0:58:40.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Later. Surprise! It's me, Yuffie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.21,0:58:42.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, hey, all the kids are missing from Wutai.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.80,0:58:46.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you heard anything? Give me a ring and fill me in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.98,0:58:55.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never blamed you, not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.55,0:59:01.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You came for me. That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.99,0:59:44.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening? Why the hell are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.50,1:00:34.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Denzel?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.14,1:00:41.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Denzel. Denzel!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.49,1:01:04.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what are we up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.60,1:01:15.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother's here, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.89,1:01:17.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you figure?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.42,1:01:19.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,This, what you call it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.95,1:01:21.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Monument.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.81,1:01:23.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,I bet Shinra made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.51,1:01:26.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, you used your head, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.91,1:01:28.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.45,1:01:29.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.89,1:01:32.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't know anything about it either.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.03,1:01:38.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see, as if anyone would trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.00,1:01:43.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rude!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.52,1:01:46.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.23,1:02:06.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.12,1:02:10.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.20,1:02:13.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, not as bad as Denzel's.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.51,1:02:16.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can it be cure?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.43,1:02:18.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.23,1:02:25.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,For Denzel's sake, you've been trying so hard to find a cure for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.24,1:02:28.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,You knew about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.59,1:02:32.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, you should cleanup your desk sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.72,1:02:34.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.01,1:02:40.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say Cloud, because you can't fix Denzel's stigma,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.01,1:02:44.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,is that the reason why you left?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.04,1:02:48.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or is it because you had the stigma too?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.27,1:02:54.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just thought I could take care for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.45,1:02:57.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.05,1:03:02.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,How can you look after your family if you can't even take a good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.87,1:03:07.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or, at least that is what daddy would say.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.68,1:03:10.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.24,1:03:19.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, and Denzel, and Tifa always be there to help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.12,1:03:23.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're always there whenever I needed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.43,1:03:28.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,For now, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.31,1:03:29.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.91,1:03:42.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say, Kadaj. I've got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.95,1:03:46.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just one question then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.63,1:03:52.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You said you needed Jenova cells in order to return to what you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.35,1:03:54.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.45,1:03:59.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.33,1:04:04.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sephiroth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.48,1:04:05.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,The nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.91,1:04:07.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,So they say.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.16,1:04:08.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.72,1:04:11.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know Sephiroth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.36,1:04:15.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I know he's close.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.50,1:04:18.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,It gets under my skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.13,1:04:22.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if Mother loves him more than?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.36,1:04:24.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Poor little remnants.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.48,1:04:28.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. You'll meet the same fate either way!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.81,1:04:32.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother came to this planet after a long journey.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.73,1:04:36.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,To rid the cosmos of fools like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.11,1:04:40.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you know about it as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.91,1:04:46.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing's changed since Mother came here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.52,1:04:49.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to change it. To make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.55,1:04:58.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I wouldn't do, if she only asked. Hmph, the nightmare comes again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.41,1:05:05.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,As long as you exist, the nightmares will come again and again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.52,1:05:09.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Lifestream courses through our planet
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.89,1:05:13.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,back and forth across the borders of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.52,1:05:16.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,If that cycle is the very truth of life
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.99,1:05:20.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,then history, too, will inevitably repeat itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.62,1:05:23.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,So go on, bring your Jenovas and your Sephiroths.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.67,1:05:26.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,It won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.99,1:05:30.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll do as life dictates
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.17,1:05:35.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,and stop you every single time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.45,1:05:42.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, is that an excuse for taking Mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.01,1:05:44.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're feeling remorse?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.87,1:05:46.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remorse?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.06,1:05:50.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, I've never had this much fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.63,1:05:57.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.40,1:06:01.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let's put an end to all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.31,1:07:09.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Denzel, we've got to get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.03,1:07:59.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.53,1:08:33.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it coming after us?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.23,1:08:34.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go ask it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.43,1:09:14.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Having fun yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.97,1:09:17.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.18,1:09:25.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't you guys just call it a day? !
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.45,1:09:28.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,We will.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.85,1:09:31.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you give back Mother, that'll be the end of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.60,1:09:40.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damned punks
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.90,1:09:43.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,what do you need Jenova's head for?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.41,1:09:58.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forget your little Reunion and get a grip!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.45,1:10:02.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,All we want is to be with Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.52,1:10:11.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother will know what's best. She'll tell us what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.09,1:10:14.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.14,1:10:33.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother, mother. It's Jenova's frigging head!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.18,1:10:36.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't talk about Mother like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.08,1:10:37.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unforgiven!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.36,1:10:42.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.79,1:10:44.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.63,1:10:46.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are we apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.91,1:11:37.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tifa?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.18,1:11:44.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.10,1:11:58.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look after Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.17,1:12:00.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barret!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.47,1:12:03.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marlene's safe, right? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.02,1:12:20.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't match this!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.72,1:12:54.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's using my materia? !
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.82,1:12:56.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,The bad guys, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.49,1:12:58.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.21,1:13:00.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.12,1:13:07.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,The latest model, Sierra!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.75,1:13:11.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll let you ride it later!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.36,1:13:14.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the phone shop?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.64,1:13:17.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's that person?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.97,1:13:19.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,These are our friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.50,1:13:24.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Denzel, can you make it to the bar?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.82,1:13:53.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.30,1:13:57.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tifa!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.57,1:14:04.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Denzel!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.24,1:14:28.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.89,1:14:40.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm a little late.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.63,1:14:43.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.99,1:14:51.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.33,1:14:56.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marlene's safe. I took her home.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.47,1:15:01.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,It feels a little lighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.18,1:15:09.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I wore it down by dragging it along so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.79,1:15:18.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to the bar. I'll be waiting with Marlene.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.53,1:15:24.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna come home, right, Cloud?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.77,1:16:06.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.25,1:18:10.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're late dammit!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.78,1:19:19.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun Boss? What should we summon next?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.50,1:19:31.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother? A good son would have known.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.83,1:19:47.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.20,1:20:08.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Haiya!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.15,1:20:23.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.56,1:20:34.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.00,1:21:13.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.85,1:22:05.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.83,1:22:15.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boss! Boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:22:59.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.68,1:24:41.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mess up with the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.40,1:25:34.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rude!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.16,1:25:49.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is bad! This is bad! This is bad yo!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.13,1:25:54.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ooh, Rude. You're alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.51,1:25:55.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yea.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.71,1:25:57.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just peachy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.01,1:26:29.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.23,1:28:25.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.33,1:28:30.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,This thing got any bite?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.30,1:28:33.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shinra technology at its finest.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.97,1:28:35.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you made this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.51,1:28:39.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know about the power, but it sure is flashy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.34,1:28:41.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ohhoh!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.48,1:28:44.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,You like that, don't you, partner?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.65,1:28:47.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,No overtime tonight, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.39,1:30:03.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.00,1:30:17.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.87,1:30:21.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.58,1:32:07.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.41,1:32:39.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've finally found Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.52,1:32:42.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.89,1:32:47.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother will tell me, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.86,1:32:52.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess a remnanets won't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.63,1:32:57.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,So what if I'm a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.14,1:33:07.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You used to be no different!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.67,1:33:36.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud, I brought you materia!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.74,1:33:40.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't shake it! Yo, Cid! Land this junk heap.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.64,1:33:43.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You want off, you jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.71,1:33:45.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let them fight by themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.88,1:33:50.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kadaj is an avatar of Sephiroth.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.09,1:33:52.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think of him as a sort of larval form.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.16,1:33:55.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Larva? You mean he's some kinda insect?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.79,1:33:57.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.46,1:33:59.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,So that punk's gonna become Sephiroth?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.90,1:34:03.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, Cloud, does he know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.90,1:34:06.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.60,1:34:08.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.18,1:34:10.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.87,1:34:13.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't get it! Someone explain it to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.01,1:34:15.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is man talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.48,1:34:17.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sexist. Sexist!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.45,1:34:19.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you calm down, Princess! ?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.61,1:34:21.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some of the men ain't following either.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.68,1:34:28.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two years ago During our last battle do you remember what it was like to be strong?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.61,1:34:33.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's only been two years but somehow that strength has slipped away
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.20,1:34:37.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think Cloud's found it again though.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.16,1:34:39.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll give him 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.90,1:34:43.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Always a pain in the ass, that Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.44,1:34:46.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least he's honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.92,1:36:06.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll show you my Reunion.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.78,1:36:30.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.26,1:36:47.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your stigma is gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.16,1:36:50.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.03,1:36:53.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just what do you really want?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.00,1:36:57.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ghosts of geostigma victims.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.61,1:37:01.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,They will rejoin the Lifestream and circle the planet
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.41,1:37:04.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eventually it infringes on the planet
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.11,1:37:07.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,What I really want, Cloud
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.38,1:37:12.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,is to sail the darkness of the cosmos with this planet as my vessel
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.99,1:37:17.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,just as my mother did long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.00,1:37:27.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then one day we'll find a new planet
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.40,1:37:30.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,and on its soil we'll create a shining future.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.61,1:37:32.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,What will happen to this planet?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.64,1:37:36.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that's up to you to decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.17,1:37:59.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.87,1:38:48.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where did you find this strength?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.55,1:38:50.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.79,1:39:28.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've thought of a wonderful present for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.33,1:39:37.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shall I give you despair?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.68,1:39:51.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kneel. Beg for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.58,1:41:46.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this the pain you felt before, Cloud?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.95,1:41:53.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you again, And this time, engraved into your memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.45,1:42:22.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you treasure most?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.75,1:42:26.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want the joy of taking it from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.27,1:42:35.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what if they look hopeless?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.96,1:42:38.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,If it were me, I still wouldn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.07,1:42:43.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Embrace your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.18,1:42:48.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Also, whatever happen protect your honor as a SOLDIER.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.86,1:42:51.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never made as a SOLDIER.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.45,1:42:53.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,But it's the feeling that count, the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.94,1:42:56.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.50,1:43:00.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, do you need a help there?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.67,1:43:11.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You already beat him once didn't you? This should be an easy one, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.93,1:43:13.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yea.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.74,1:43:19.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.78,1:43:20.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.31,1:43:24.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,the proof that you existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.42,1:43:36.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,How sad. You who understand nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.75,1:43:39.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is nothing I don't treasure!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.28,1:44:20.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay in my memories where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.99,1:44:31.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will never be a memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.36,1:45:03.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brother
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.16,1:45:07.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kadaj?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.94,1:45:25.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can let it go now, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.75,1:45:32.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.62,1:45:37.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting, if you're ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.81,1:47:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,He did it! That's how it goes!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.32,1:47:06.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,A man! Cloudsan's a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.98,1:47:09.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? Just like I told you. He can do anything if he puts his mind to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.32,1:47:11.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.20,1:47:24.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were always with us, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.27,1:47:27.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.88,1:48:11.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's all go home together.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.92,1:48:19.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,And play with everyone
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.08,1:48:46.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.55,1:48:55.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cloud said he'd come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.47,1:49:19.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.49,1:50:46.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.63,1:50:52.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why does everyone keep calling me that?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.63,1:50:57.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess they must be fond of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.27,1:51:01.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think this one's outgrown me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.37,1:51:07.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tough luck, friend. Looks like your place isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.87,1:52:08.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,She said to wait here for Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.01,1:52:13.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.15,1:52:25.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Im home.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.09,1:52:30.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are still children with the stigma.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.77,1:52:43.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's time to get fixed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.84,1:52:47.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.38,1:52:51.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.57,1:53:47.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last one in is a rotten egg! It worked, it worked!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.85,1:54:39.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're all right now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.95,1:55:09.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.68,2:05:55.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whose grave is this?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.56,2:05:58.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.67,2:06:03.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is where the "hero" began his journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:04.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,曾对这个世界有爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:08.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,和主人公们一同冒险的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:14.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们再度欢聚一堂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,破坏与创造
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类为何一直重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:47.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真是无法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:55.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类不擅长面对回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:58.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以美化它 夸大它
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:03.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,试图用怀念来包装疼痛来走出过去的阴霾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:06.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要取回妈妈?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:09.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,也是出于怀念?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:15.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是为了克服眼前的难题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你指星痕?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:22.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实归根到底都是你们的错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:25.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:31.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来你也无法面对回忆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:34.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:38.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是忘记了我的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,(两星期前)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,曾先生!快看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:57.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:01.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,惨不忍睹是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:07.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁关心?总之快一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷诺 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:29.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂喂喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,前辈 快离开!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,前辈!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:43.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,伊利娜!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:47.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你快走!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:56.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,曾先生!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:11.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是要让她犹豫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,生命之河
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:48.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是围绕着星球的生命之河
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:53.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球和她滋养的万物生灵的源头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:57.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,神罗公司发现了把生命之河
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:01.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,当作能源使用的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:08.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,多亏了它 使我们的生活变的非常富裕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:13.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是这种方法会剥削星球的生命?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:16.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,也有很多人这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:24.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,神罗对于反对他的人们使用武力镇压
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:31.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,神罗麾下有一批特种兵名为战士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,是很久以前从天而降
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:37.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,以毁灭星球为己任的灾厄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:41.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰诺娃细胞的移植产物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:46.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,有位名叫萨菲罗斯的士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常优秀的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:53.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过从他得知了自己诞生于恐怖实验的事实后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,因此对神罗怀恨在心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:06:03.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,久而久之 他开始憎恨这一切的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:09.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,憎恨神罗和反对它的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:11.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,萨菲罗斯憎恨到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不惜一切摧毁星球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:18.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,很多人竭力阻止萨菲罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,带来了无数战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:27.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,战争与悲剧也形影不离
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:33.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我最喜爱的人也化作了生命之河
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,终于在那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:39.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,命运之日
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:45.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球用自身的力量平息了一切干戈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:50.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球把生命之河用作武器
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:53.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,喷出地面的生命之河
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,将纷争 野望 悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:02.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,统统吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:10.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,"我们用悲伤划上了句点"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:13.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样的说法是从两年前开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:02.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,往那移 往那移
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:12.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,姐姐 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:13.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过星球它远比我们想像的更要愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,星痕群后遗症
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:56.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说 马琳?变什么样了?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:05.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,求求您 请不要带走丹泽尔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:14.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,"根据调查委今晨颁布的报告"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:17.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,"大气中的生命之河浓度"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:20.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,"仅为2年前的百分之一 "
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:26.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,"已经降至对人体毫无影响的程度"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,"然而 神罗公司大厦以及所属的周边地区"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:29.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里人去楼空了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:31.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,"依然屹立于危险浓度中"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:35.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,"为了防患星痕群后遗症 请远离存在隐患的设施"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:37.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,"委员会如上警告"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:42.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来报导神罗公司被追究的赔偿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:47.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德 你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:05.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,您好 是冲突快递 我们服务广泛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:09.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,请问是哪位?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 当然记得你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:40.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷诺从圆球别墅来电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:42.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要委托你工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德 你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:46.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,讯息完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:56.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,《最终幻想7：圣子降临》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.13,0:12:01.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说卡达裘?那就是哥哥的城镇吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:03.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:06.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想他会欢迎我们吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:08.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能的 可别哭啊 亚祖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,但妈妈和他在一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:15.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可难说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,别哭啊 罗兹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧啊 说人到就到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:07.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:14.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,被哥哥给藏起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:26.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,难到 你骗我?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈果然还在你们手中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,别吼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,懒得和你说了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,换社长接
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:04.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是逃避了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:09.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 我是巴雷特!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:15.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,老子成功了!找到新油田了!油 田
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:16.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,超级大!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:18.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,工作差不多完成后 不久就去见马琳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:20.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我问候一下!拜啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:27.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷诺又打电话来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:31.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,催你赶快去 总觉得有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:34.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你自己要当心啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.61,0:16:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的 果然有两下子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,鲁德 有型啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:27.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不愧是自封的前战士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,身手依旧不凡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:50.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是路法斯?你也真是倒楣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,那天我 找我有什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:59.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,大楼坍塌前总算是 袭击我的人是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:01.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,助我一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:08.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,没兴趣 我们神罗公司
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:11.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,欠世界一笔大债
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:14.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,害得世界惨淡而寥落
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:18.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们把责任推给我们也合乎情理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:21.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,于是这笔债非还不可
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,开门啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,作为第一步棋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:29.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们调查起萨菲罗斯遗留的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:32.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,过去两年了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:34.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界迈出了复兴的一步
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:37.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么构成了最大威胁?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:44.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 是万恶的星痕群后遗症
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:49.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们认为原因出在萨菲罗斯身上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,世人认为魔晃炉 魔晃能源
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:59.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,以及生命之河是星痕的原因正在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:02.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看未必吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:04.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,生命之河与星球一起诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:09.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,魔晃能源更有40多年的利用史
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽管如此 星痕在历史上从未有过登场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:21.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么我们这一代和有不同寻常?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:23.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,想不出别的了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:26.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,是萨菲罗斯的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:27.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,萨菲罗斯死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:29.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的精神去了哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:34.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,溶解在了生命之河中倘若它未扩散而巡行在星球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:37.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,那会怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:42.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然这终究是我的猜测
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:45.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,却也不无可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:49.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,发现真相才能推动星痕的治愈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:55.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,于是我们调查了萨菲罗斯留下的蛛丝马迹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:19:00.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,先前 你还记得?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,在北方的大空洞!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你猜发现了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,在那儿什么都没有 放心好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:15.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过却发生了出乎我们意料之外的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:19.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:32.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,曾先生!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:36.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡达裘一伙儿人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:39.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡达裘?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,他连你也不会放过?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:46.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你与他们有交过手?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:48.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,迟早会物归原主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:53.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你与我们一样与萨菲罗斯有很深的过往
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:59.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果卡达裘的目的 是给来临的那一刻做铺垫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:03.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们无疑是最大的障碍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,铺垫?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:07.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,萨菲罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:10.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,卷土重来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:11.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,话说完了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:13.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么回归正题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:19.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了与卡达裘他们抗衡 我们需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:21.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,何不并肩作战?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:24.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,前战士克劳德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:27.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我自称罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈是是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.81,0:20:40.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,不清楚 卡达裘说了什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,路法斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.75,0:20:44.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你隐瞒了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:49.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你我站在同一战线 我怎么会隐瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:53.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于星痕的情报想必你也需要?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:57.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了生活在同一屋檐下的孤儿们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:03.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道你不想让那些孩子们重拾笑容吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:10.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的最终目的是重建世界 克劳德
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:20.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 拜托了 克劳德
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,让神罗公司东山再起!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:29.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷诺!雷诺!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:54.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德住在这里吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:57.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,好像是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:06.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:29.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,和丹泽尔一样 克劳德也生病了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:32.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:35.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,是因为生病才离开吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.59,0:22:38.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要独自去战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.34,0:22:40.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,战斗? 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:45.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,他根本没有斗志
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:47.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂法?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:51.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们回去吧 马琳?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.41,0:22:55.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要! 我要见克劳德!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:07.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,想见他啊? 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:10.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,那 见面之后怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:12.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,带他回家!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.76,0:23:16.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过在那之前先念他一顿!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.57,0:23:18.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,赞成!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:23.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来要找主任和伊利娜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:28.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他社员提供的情报呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.55,0:23:30.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,暂时没有收获
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.52,0:23:39.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来的社员来齐了这么多真是超出预料
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.85,0:23:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我超感动的 我看能重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.81,0:23:48.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,赎罪的重任落在活下来的人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.25,0:23:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,过去两年了 嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.16,0:23:58.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,才两年啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.38,0:24:01.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,那简直是噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.77,0:24:04.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界险些灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们神罗惹的祸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.41,0:24:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,说真的 我们要赎多少罪啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.85,0:24:18.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,少了主任果然很头疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:20.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,伊利娜也是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.36,0:24:26.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,千万给我活的好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.37,0:24:28.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.15,0:24:32.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,曾先生和社长一样 九死一生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:34.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,运气好的很
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:36.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:47.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.09,0:25:00.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,教堂?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.30,0:25:05.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 那个地方的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.27,0:25:08.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 我等你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.50,0:26:40.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,您拨打七号街的电话暂时无法接通
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.69,0:26:45.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,您拨打七号街的电话暂时无法接通
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:50.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,您拨打七号街的电话暂时无法接通
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.84,0:26:56.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,您拨打七号街的电话暂时无法接通
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.31,0:27:01.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,您拨打七号街的电话暂时无法接通
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.16,0:27:39.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德 真意外接到你的电话?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.56,0:27:41.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,出事了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.34,0:27:45.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.36,0:27:48.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.54,0:27:52.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁?这是克劳德的电话吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.61,0:27:54.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.57,0:27:56.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:28:03.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,不清楚 我不知道怎么办好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.31,0:28:08.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哭吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.24,0:28:19.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你没事吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.39,0:28:22.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德!克劳德!你在那吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.07,0:28:31.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:38.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.96,0:29:23.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我讨厌说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.29,0:29:27.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我不好 这次我会实话实说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.78,0:29:31.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,那东西在摆脱你们的途中从直升机上掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.63,0:29:34.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,太失态了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.18,0:29:36.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:39.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.93,0:29:43.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,不妨向这个发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.42,0:29:54.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的目的是什么? 我需要妈妈的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.88,0:29:59.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了再结合绝不能少了她
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:00.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,再结合?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.37,0:30:04.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,获得妈妈细胞的同伴齐聚一堂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.94,0:30:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后向这星球报复
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.07,0:30:11.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备工作稳步进行着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.18,0:30:15.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你瞧 都怪某些人把妈妈藏了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.08,0:30:17.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:22.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,星痕 社长你也很清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.06,0:30:27.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,这多亏在生命之河中 有妈妈的遗传意念在挣扎着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.29,0:30:34.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,再看看我们 居然不清楚妈妈在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.33,0:30:41.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,丢死人了 但却无可奈何 谁让我们是区区意念体
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:47.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有找到妈妈后分得细胞 我们才能够复原
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.08,0:30:51.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,光有意念和星痕远谈不上准备充分
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.22,0:30:54.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了完美的再结合
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.42,0:30:55.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.76,0:31:02.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,社长 你早就查觉到了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:40.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.78,0:31:45.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇 星痕!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.57,0:31:52.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,别出门吓唬人啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.18,0:32:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.01,0:32:41.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会连你的份好好活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.99,0:32:45.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然那时是这样决定
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.45,0:32:48.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,想成为战士啊?加把劲!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.86,0:32:50.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂 感觉如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.53,0:32:53.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说 到达米德加尔后 你怎么打算?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.12,0:32:56.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是朋友吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.36,0:33:06.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,大叔 找个岩石在后面停车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.83,0:33:08.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德 我们下车!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.07,0:33:14.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的荣耀和梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.08,0:33:18.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,全给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.20,0:33:20.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.75,0:33:24.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我生命的见证
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.79,0:33:31.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,那时候发誓过决不忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.61,0:33:34.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.98,0:33:44.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,别假装悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.90,0:33:49.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,也别假装义愤填膺
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.41,0:33:54.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道因为什么?克劳德
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.10,0:33:58.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你是 傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.19,0:34:27.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起玩吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:32.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.73,0:34:36.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.61,0:34:45.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.98,0:34:51.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说 妈妈呢 这里没有别人了!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.65,0:34:55.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.17,0:35:10.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,真令人期待
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.05,0:36:28.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂法!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.81,0:36:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,找错地方了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.58,0:37:02.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没哭!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.92,0:37:06.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道了 我带她去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.82,0:37:13.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.72,0:38:13.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.92,0:38:14.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,快逃啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.18,0:38:35.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:39.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.26,0:38:48.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.95,0:38:53.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.98,0:38:56.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.43,0:39:00.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也得了星痕吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.55,0:39:03.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 有人能治好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.27,0:39:57.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂法?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.91,0:40:01.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂法!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.22,0:40:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来得太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.48,0:40:11.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁干的?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.32,0:40:15.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,不认识的人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.79,0:40:18.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,马琳?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.84,0:40:27.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.07,0:41:40.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,重死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.81,0:41:44.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,哥哥 你跟孩子们生活的吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.55,0:41:46.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,全不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.49,0:41:52.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,不担心吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.29,0:41:56.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.20,0:42:09.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不坦白
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.94,0:42:24.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂法要我带你过去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.27,0:42:28.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.76,0:43:05.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁会治好我们?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.19,0:43:10.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.12,0:43:17.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 管他是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.35,0:43:38.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来是哥哥藏的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.13,0:43:43.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,从生命之河中诞生的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.36,0:43:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,让魔石球赐给我们新能力
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.93,0:43:57.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是妈妈留给我们的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.52,0:43:59.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 一定是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.40,0:44:02.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈也被哥哥藏起来了?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.35,0:44:06.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 是那个社长
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.27,0:44:10.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,神罗公司一向喜欢把妈妈藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.04,0:44:16.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不妨把神罗的相关建筑搜个遍
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.54,0:44:20.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 更多伙伴会蜂拥而至
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.31,0:44:23.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好期待!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.72,0:44:27.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过先要
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.13,0:44:30.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,向哥哥发发牢骚
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.35,0:44:34.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,装作自己是局外人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.38,0:44:38.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,真令人悲哀
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.56,0:44:47.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,呐?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.56,0:45:10.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷诺他们在四处打听
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.80,0:45:19.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,星痕群后遗症 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.84,0:45:24.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,死了也无所谓吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.14,0:45:30.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.55,0:45:33.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有治愈的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.82,0:45:36.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 丹泽尔却从来不放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.15,0:45:39.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们一起面对它不好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.59,0:45:42.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,互相帮助 一起奋斗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.93,0:45:48.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是真正的家人 果然不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.10,0:45:50.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可能
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.27,0:45:54.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁也救不了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.60,0:45:59.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,家人也好 同伴也好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.31,0:46:00.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,都救不了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.75,0:46:05.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,拖拖拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.59,0:46:13.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,拖拖拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.56,0:46:16.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,要拖到什么时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.73,0:46:18.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,还找不到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.59,0:46:20.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,有目击者
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.16,0:46:23.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,说是被那帮家伙带走的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.00,0:46:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,去了哪里? 遗忘之都
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.30,0:46:29.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们老家
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.09,0:46:47.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈眷顾我一份特殊力量
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.12,0:46:50.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球作战的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.33,0:46:53.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,能与折磨人的罪魁
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.83,0:47:00.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实你们也有这个能力
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.67,0:47:02.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.21,0:47:06.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.51,0:47:09.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,继承了溶解在生命之河中
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.41,0:47:13.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈遗传意念的被选中的一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.08,0:47:17.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.85,0:47:21.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球在百般阻挠
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.76,0:47:25.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,它试图停止我们成长
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.03,0:47:31.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以说你们遭受皮肉之苦痛不欲生!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.87,0:47:35.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来帮你们治好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.61,0:47:39.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后回到妈妈身边
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.61,0:47:44.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,一家人齐心协力报复星球
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.82,0:47:51.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟着我做
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.67,0:48:39.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,丹泽尔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.47,0:48:44.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,丹泽尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.69,0:48:58.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈 您瞧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.28,0:49:01.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,多了这么多兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.54,0:49:08.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到与妈妈见面我也不会寂寞了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.27,0:49:49.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你终于来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.27,0:49:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,明明自己都快撑不住了 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.54,0:49:57.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定会好转的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.21,0:50:00.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我问你!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.58,0:50:03.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么要来这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.75,0:50:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想想获得原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.55,0:50:13.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 我想被原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.86,0:50:16.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,被谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.38,0:51:07.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你果然来了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.12,0:51:09.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来接孩子们回家
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.32,0:51:12.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个人啊 是我们的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.12,0:51:14.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.06,0:51:18.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,很可惜的是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.63,0:51:21.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.03,0:51:26.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.94,0:53:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,还真是救不了任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.64,0:53:52.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,文森特 怎样一回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.58,0:53:56.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我常来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.92,0:54:01.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,因而卡达裘们的一举一动我全看在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.16,0:54:04.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,所谓星痕
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.23,0:54:07.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,是在我们身体里有像生命之河潮流
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.10,0:54:10.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,排除体内异物的系统反应过剩所致
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.83,0:54:16.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,体内也有类似生命之河的循环
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.24,0:54:20.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,它与入侵的邪恶物质对峙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.44,0:54:24.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,邪恶物质
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.01,0:54:28.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,萨菲罗斯因子 杰诺娃的遗传意念
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.38,0:54:30.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,随你怎么称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.79,0:54:34.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好详细
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.86,0:54:36.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,曾和伊利娜
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.96,0:54:39.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,奄奄一息着被搬到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.39,0:54:42.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,想必是被严加拷问的后果
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.06,0:54:46.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,救倒是救了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.10,0:54:49.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,生死难说
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.57,0:54:51.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,拷问?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.51,0:54:53.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,自作自受
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.21,0:54:55.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们似乎把杰诺娃的人头弄到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.18,0:54:59.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡达裘所找的妈妈是指?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.25,0:55:03.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,从天而降的凶神 杰诺娃
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.15,0:55:07.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,用她造出第二个萨菲罗斯也不无可能
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.86,0:55:10.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡达裘
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.03,0:55:12.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么人?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.69,0:55:15.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.87,0:55:27.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,马琳!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.08,0:55:30.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德!丹泽尔和蒂法她!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.78,0:55:31.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂法没有事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.11,0:55:34.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要跟蒂法说话!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.29,0:55:40.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有手机吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.29,0:55:44.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.39,0:55:49.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,文森特 帮我把马琳送到店里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.96,0:55:52.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去找神罗他们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.27,0:55:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不赞成这样做 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.74,0:55:56.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了 克劳德!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.40,0:55:59.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么总是一意孤行?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.08,0:56:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,马琳 再忍耐一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.55,0:56:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想战斗马上就会开始
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.05,0:56:11.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 光靠刀枪不能解决问题 你明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.79,0:56:13.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不明白!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.65,0:56:16.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德 你打算开战吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.83,0:56:19.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.06,0:56:21.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,遗忘之都
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.93,0:56:24.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们老家
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.90,0:56:29.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.91,0:56:38.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去和路法斯谈谈 你别逃避!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.65,0:56:40.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.01,0:56:43.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算找到孩子们可能也无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.72,0:56:46.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,也有可能会造成无法挽回的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.35,0:56:47.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你害怕会变成这样 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.91,0:56:50.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过请你面对更多的现实吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.62,0:56:53.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,很沉重吗? 因为沉重到无法承受了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.36,0:56:55.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,学不会一个人生活就要学会忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.03,0:56:57.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你明明很讨厌孤单 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.73,0:57:01.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然不接电话 但手机却从不离身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.07,0:57:07.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们老家 你还不快去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.22,0:57:19.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道我们输给了回忆不成?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.59,0:57:29.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是因为我曾经见死不救啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.30,0:57:32.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是拖拖拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.10,0:57:36.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说该是时候原谅自己了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.51,0:57:42.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的罪能被原谅吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.14,0:57:44.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没试过
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.95,0:57:46.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,试试看?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.01,0:57:48.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.22,0:57:54.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,马琳 我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.26,0:58:00.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.20,0:58:03.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果我会通知你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.68,0:58:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是里布
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.29,0:58:27.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,工作的怎么样了?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.72,0:58:31.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看过广告了 但那东西真能赚钱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.29,0:58:33.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然那很适合 克劳德先生
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.76,0:58:35.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,但如果可以的话我也想帮忙 所以再连络
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.76,0:58:37.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,有工作委托你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.46,0:58:40.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,超级大!工作完工后会去看马琳 帮我问后一下 拜了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.21,0:58:42.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,五台的孩子们失踪一事 你知道是怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.80,0:58:46.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果知道些事情的话 拜托你告诉我 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.98,0:58:55.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你自己当心啊 我从不觉得你有对不起我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.55,0:59:01.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是来了吗 这样就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.99,0:59:44.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们聋了?喂 装听不见啊 做这种事要干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.50,1:00:34.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,丹泽尔?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.14,1:00:41.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,丹泽尔 丹泽尔!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.49,1:01:04.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.60,1:01:15.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈就在这儿吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.89,1:01:17.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.42,1:01:19.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个叫什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.95,1:01:21.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,纪念碑
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.81,1:01:23.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,是神罗做的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.51,1:01:26.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以说藏在这里?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.91,1:01:28.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,不对吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.45,1:01:29.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.89,1:01:32.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.03,1:01:38.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看 果然是藏在某地
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.00,1:01:43.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,鲁德!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.52,1:01:46.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来顶句话啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.23,1:02:06.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,痛吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.12,1:02:10.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.20,1:02:13.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过没有丹泽尔那么痛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.51,1:02:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,能治好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.43,1:02:18.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.23,1:02:25.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为了丹泽尔找遍了各种方法
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.24,1:02:28.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.59,1:02:32.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁叫你从来不收拾桌子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.72,1:02:34.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.01,1:02:40.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德是因为丹泽尔的星痕治不好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.01,1:02:44.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以离家出走的?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.04,1:02:48.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是因为自己也有了星痕?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.27,1:02:54.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 连自己都无法保护了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.45,1:02:57.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是那么想啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.05,1:03:02.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,无法保护自己的人 还谈什么保护家人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.87,1:03:07.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我老爹说的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.68,1:03:10.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德 你别放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.24,1:03:19.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,马琳 丹泽尔 蒂法 总是在帮助我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.12,1:03:23.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我总是被人保护着
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.43,1:03:28.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这回要轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.31,1:03:29.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.91,1:03:42.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,呐 卡达裘 问你一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.95,1:03:46.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,仅此一件
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.63,1:03:52.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说过要用杰诺娃细胞来能恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.35,1:03:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.45,1:03:59.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,他会回来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.33,1:04:04.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,萨菲罗斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.48,1:04:05.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,噩梦啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.91,1:04:07.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,好像是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.16,1:04:08.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,好像是?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.72,1:04:11.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟萨菲罗斯没有瓜葛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.36,1:04:15.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是对他有感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.50,1:04:18.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,真让人心烦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.13,1:04:22.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈会选择我和萨菲罗斯哪一个呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.36,1:04:24.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,意念体真是可怜
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.48,1:04:28.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正你们的下场只有一个!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.81,1:04:32.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈长途跋涉来到这个星球
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.73,1:04:36.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了让愚蠢的家伙们灰飞烟灭
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.11,1:04:40.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过你也很清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.91,1:04:46.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里和妈妈来的时候相比丝毫没改善
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.52,1:04:49.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我想让妈妈开心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.55,1:04:58.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈要我做什么 我就做什么 哼 噩梦再临是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.41,1:05:05.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们一日不消失 就会重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.52,1:05:09.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球上循环往复的生命之河
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.89,1:05:13.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,在生死之间徘徊而无阻
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.52,1:05:16.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果生命的原貌就是这般周而复始
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.99,1:05:20.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,那历史的重演也就是必然事件
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.62,1:05:23.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰诺娃也好 萨菲罗斯也好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.67,1:05:26.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,就随你们喜欢做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.99,1:05:30.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会听从命运的安排
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.17,1:05:35.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,会一次又一次的阻止你们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.45,1:05:42.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,社长 这就是你们抢走妈妈的藉口吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.01,1:05:44.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实你该不会是很后悔吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.87,1:05:46.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,后悔?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.06,1:05:50.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可是乐此不疲
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.63,1:05:57.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,那再好不过
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.40,1:06:01.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么差不多也该结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.31,1:07:09.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,丹泽尔 快逃!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.03,1:07:59.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这东西 算了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.53,1:08:33.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,它来没?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.23,1:08:34.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,没胆量看?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.43,1:09:14.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,乐趣无穷啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.97,1:09:17.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,无聊透顶啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.18,1:09:25.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有完没完?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.45,1:09:28.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是说了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.85,1:09:31.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要把妈妈交出来 这一切就都结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.60,1:09:40.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,废物
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.90,1:09:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们拿杰诺娃的头做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.41,1:09:58.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,说什么再结合 吃错药了!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.45,1:10:02.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只不过是想见妈妈!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.52,1:10:11.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈会决定今后的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.09,1:10:14.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么妈妈在哪?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.14,1:10:33.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈来妈妈去的 不就是杰诺娃的项上人头吗!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.18,1:10:36.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂!不许你这么称呼妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.08,1:10:37.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,饶不了你!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.36,1:10:42.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.79,1:10:44.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.63,1:10:46.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛要道歉啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.91,1:11:37.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂法?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.18,1:11:44.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.10,1:11:58.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这儿保护你妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.17,1:12:00.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴雷特
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.47,1:12:03.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,马琳还好好的吧 啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.02,1:12:20.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,打不过啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.72,1:12:54.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁动了我的魔石球?!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.82,1:12:56.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用问 当然是坏人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.49,1:12:58.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.21,1:13:00.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.12,1:13:07.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,新型的希艾拉号!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.75,1:13:11.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,待会儿让你们坐坐!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.36,1:13:14.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,手机店在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.64,1:13:17.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.97,1:13:19.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.50,1:13:24.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,丹泽尔 能一个人跑回店里吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.82,1:13:53.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,有完没完!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.30,1:13:57.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,蒂法!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.57,1:14:04.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,丹泽尔!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.24,1:14:28.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.89,1:14:40.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我来晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.63,1:14:43.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.99,1:14:51.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.33,1:14:56.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,马琳很安全 我把她留在了店里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.47,1:15:01.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得轻松多了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.18,1:15:09.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,总拖来拖去 拖轻了包袱
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.79,1:15:18.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一个人回店里吧 跟马琳等你们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.53,1:15:24.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德也会回家吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.77,1:16:06.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁会输给你啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.25,1:18:10.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来的太晚了!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.78,1:19:19.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,太愉快了 社长 接下来召唤什么好呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.50,1:19:31.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈?该早点发现啊 不肖子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.83,1:19:47.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,宰了它 克劳德!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.20,1:20:08.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,去吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.15,1:20:23.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.56,1:20:34.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,还早着呢!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.00,1:21:13.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,去吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.85,1:22:05.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.83,1:22:15.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,社长!社长!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:22:59.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,社长!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.68,1:24:41.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,打架不要找错人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.40,1:25:34.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,鲁德!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.16,1:25:49.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好不好!大事不好!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.13,1:25:54.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 鲁德 你没事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.51,1:25:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.71,1:25:57.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实很有事
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.01,1:26:29.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,前辈!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.23,1:28:25.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说搭档
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.33,1:28:30.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个很厉害吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.30,1:28:33.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,凝聚了神罗的科技与汗水
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.97,1:28:35.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你研发的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.51,1:28:39.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,威力姑且不说 华丽得很
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.34,1:28:41.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂喂!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.48,1:28:44.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,喜欢吧 搭档?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.65,1:28:47.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来今天不用加班了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.39,1:30:03.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.00,1:30:17.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.87,1:30:21.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.58,1:32:07.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走 克劳德
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.41,1:32:39.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我终于见到妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.52,1:32:42.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.89,1:32:47.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈会告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.86,1:32:52.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,意念体一无所知吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.63,1:32:57.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正我是傀儡
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.14,1:33:07.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,和过去的你没什么两样!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.67,1:33:36.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德 魔石球在此!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.74,1:33:40.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,别摇晃啊!希德!快降落
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.64,1:33:43.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,吵死了!自己不会跳啊 跳!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.71,1:33:45.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,别插手
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.88,1:33:50.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是萨菲罗斯的意念体
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.09,1:33:52.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,好比是幼虫
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.16,1:33:55.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,幼虫 虫子 他是虫子啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.79,1:33:57.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,小姑娘 安静点!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.46,1:33:59.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,早晚变身成萨菲罗斯吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.90,1:34:03.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说 克劳德知道这事吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.90,1:34:06.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,恐怕知道
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.60,1:34:08.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.18,1:34:10.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 让他一个人战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.87,1:34:13.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不明白!谁来说明一下!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.01,1:34:15.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,男人才会知道
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.48,1:34:17.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,性别歧视 大男子主义!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.45,1:34:19.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,小姑娘 闭上嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.61,1:34:21.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,是男人也不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.68,1:34:28.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,2年前 最终决战的时候明明有过的斗志?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.61,1:34:33.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,却被短短的两年时间冲淡了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.20,1:34:37.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想克劳德又点燃了斗志
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.16,1:34:39.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,切 那就等他10分钟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.90,1:34:43.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德还是一样那么难伺候
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.44,1:34:46.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,这叫坦率
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.92,1:36:06.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的再结合 让你好好见识
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.78,1:36:30.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,久违了啊 克劳德
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.26,1:36:47.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,星痕消失了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.16,1:36:50.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,很可惜
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.03,1:36:53.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你到底期望什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.00,1:36:57.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,死在星痕之下的亡魂
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.61,1:37:01.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,它和生命之河一起围绕着星球
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.41,1:37:04.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,早晚侵蚀星球
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.11,1:37:07.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德 我的愿望是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.38,1:37:12.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,以星球作舟 向宇宙的黑暗启航
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.99,1:37:17.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,就如当年的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.00,1:37:27.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们早晚会找到新的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.40,1:37:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,在新的天地创造光辉的未来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.61,1:37:32.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的星球会怎样?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.64,1:37:36.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁知道 看你的本事了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.17,1:37:59.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,姐姐?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.87,1:38:48.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦?什么使你变强了?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.55,1:38:50.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,懒得和你说
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.79,1:39:28.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直考虑该送什么给你
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.33,1:39:37.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,送你绝望如何?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.68,1:39:51.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,跪下吧 让我看看你请求饶恕的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.58,1:41:46.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,当年的痛苦你可还记得? 克劳德
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.95,1:41:53.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在赐给你更刻骨铭心的痛吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.45,1:42:22.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,对你而言什么最重要?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.75,1:42:26.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我夺来快乐一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.27,1:42:35.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,换做是我 绝对不放弃?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.96,1:42:38.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,即便情形很绝望
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.07,1:42:43.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,握紧你的梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.18,1:42:48.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,时刻与战士的荣耀同在
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.86,1:42:51.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你虽没成为战士
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.45,1:42:53.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,但也不妨抱着那颗心
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.94,1:42:56.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,扎克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.50,1:43:00.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,要我帮你一把?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.67,1:43:11.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的手下败将而已 轻松搞定他 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.93,1:43:13.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.74,1:43:19.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,别再忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.78,1:43:20.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.31,1:43:24.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你生命的见证
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.42,1:43:36.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,可悲啊 你根本什么都不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.75,1:43:39.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的一切都很重要!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.28,1:44:20.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,在回忆中安息吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.99,1:44:31.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 不会成为回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.36,1:45:03.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.16,1:45:07.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡达裘?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.94,1:45:25.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,也该放弃努力了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.75,1:45:32.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,是妈妈吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.62,1:45:37.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,回大家身边吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.81,1:47:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样 知道厉害了吧!我说的没错吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.32,1:47:06.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,男子汉!克劳德真是个男子汉!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.98,1:47:09.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了?克劳德想做就能成功
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.32,1:47:11.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们几个抓稳了!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.20,1:47:24.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一直 都在我们身边吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.27,1:47:27.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.88,1:48:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.92,1:48:19.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.08,1:48:46.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.55,1:48:55.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,克劳德也会回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.47,1:49:19.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.49,1:50:46.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.63,1:50:52.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,又来了 这是他第几次叫我妈妈了?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.63,1:50:57.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他这么想念你有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.27,1:51:01.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不要这么大的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.37,1:51:07.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,很可惜你不属于这里
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.87,1:52:08.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,姐姐说克劳德会来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.01,1:52:13.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.15,1:52:25.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.09,1:52:30.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,一些孩子还留有星痕
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.77,1:52:43.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,去吧 让他帮你治好
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.84,1:52:47.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以放心了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.38,1:52:51.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.57,1:53:47.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,都给我跳进去洗澡!治好了 治好了!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.85,1:54:39.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,以后 没问题了吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.95,1:55:09.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 并不孤单
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.68,2:05:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是谁的坟墓?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.56,2:05:58.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.67,2:06:03.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是英雄开始旅程的地方
